+# Order triage
+
+`order-triage` classifies orders for human review.
+
+Base each classification only on the supplied order information. Identify missing or ambiguous information for the human reviewer instead of guessing.
+
+Never approve a refund or represent a classification as refund approval. Leave refund decisions and financial actions to a human reviewer.

